    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 87,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "... And what a beautiful day for football it is here in South Florida!! It's Sunday, and the sun is shining and playoff berths are on the line. It doesn't get much better than this! Don't you think so, Kevin?!"
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1513,
        "text": "So, Miss P., I look forward to seeing you next year across those sidelines... and calling it what it always was and still is: a game. Let's keep it that way... So long, everybody."
      }
